{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.luca.live",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "小型 live，音响全坏了",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.luca.live",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.luca.live",
    "idolId": "luca",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "会场。观众挤到门口，后排的人一直踮着脚。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "────────",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……谢谢──────",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "最喜欢你们了──────",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "这道伤／要是能消失就好了……我是这么想的，可是……",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "它一直缠着不走……／抱歉…………",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "今天就／陪着我吧────────",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "──────继续",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "text": "第二首的间奏，音箱里炸出一声尖锐的噪声。然后全停了。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──？　不好意思，是设备吗，噪声相当────",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "text": "工作人员跑上台，观众开始交头接耳。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "────────",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "又是／　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　裂开",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "算了────",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "噪声……噪声……／全都是来碍事的────────",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "裂开────／坏掉────",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "啊哈哈……！",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "算了／就这样吧",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "────────我要唱。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "所以，给我听着。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "text": "工作人员打手势说要中止。导演在对讲里喊停。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……不……！",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "别碍事啊…………",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "别碍事啊────────…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "text": "那一瞬间，整个会场都看向舞台。除了看，什么也做不了。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……喂，ルカ。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你为什么不停下来？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "谁知道。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "只是………………",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "就是想喊出来────────",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这样啊。嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真的是一场很好的歌。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过，好像还有别的什么……有什么扎进心里了。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以听你说只是想喊出来，我好像就明白了。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "吵死了／啰嗦……",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……我想看舞台上的ルカ。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "啊…………？",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "谁是为了你才唱的。",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……是啊。今天的 live 我觉得是最棒的。",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……设备都坏了。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那些都不算什么了。今天那一刻……是最好的。谢谢你。",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……吵死了。"
      }
    }
  },
